{"4888640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Bones", "steam_appid": 4888640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888640/extras/9c28b4e015e345b5afaecef571c9e71e.poster.avif?t=1783181374\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888640/extras/9c28b4e015e345b5afaecef571c9e71e.webm?t=1783181374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888640/extras/9c28b4e015e345b5afaecef571c9e71e.mp4?t=1783181374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in real-time 1v1 battles with the denizens of a burgeoning fantasy world. With gameplay based on retro over-the-shoulder fighting games and modern roguelike RPGs, fight and explore through a savage landscape to muster your strength in hopes of avenging your fallen clan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each victory brings you closer to avenging your family. Throughout your travels, you will meet others suffering in their own ways. Will you have any compassion left to give? Or will you utilize their weakness to further your own quest for revenge.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888640/extras/9c28b4e015e345b5afaecef571c9e71e.poster.avif?t=1783181374\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4888640/extras/9c28b4e015e345b5afaecef571c9e71e.webm?t=1783181374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h